{"resourceIdentifier":"2354","resourceName":"Yichang Sunjiawan MSW landfill site LFG recovery to power project","description":"Yichang Sunjiawan MSW landfill site LFG recovery to power project is located in Xiaoting District, Yichang City, Hubei Province, P.R. China. The project is invested, constructed and operated by Yichang BCCY New Power Co., Ltd. The objective is to collect the landfill gas (LFG) from Yichang Sunjiawan MSW landfill site and utilize it to generate electricity.\r\nSunjiawan landfill site is located in Xiaoting District, Yichang City, and started operation in October 2014 with a total design effective capacity of 2,730,000 m3 and a municipal solid waste (MSW) disposal of 600 tons/d and an operational lifespan of 11 years. \r\nThe project collects and utilizes LFG from Sunjiawan landfill site for power generation, which would otherwise be released into the atmosphere. Methane in the LFG has been emitted to the atmosphere since the landfill started operation. Therefore the project avoids methane emissions and, at the same time, electricity is generated from a renewable energy source, instead of being provided by the grid.\r\nThe estimated annual average emission reduction generated by the project over the crediting period is 50,653 tCO2e per year by avoiding the CH4 emissions from the landfill and the CO2 emissions from the fossil fuel power plants in the Central China Power Grid (CCPG).","location":{"latitude":30.608640,"longitude":111.422177},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-12-04","endExclusive":"2021-01-04","endInclusive":"2021-01-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2354"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yichang BCCY New Power Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Zhengzhou, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 371 56737901"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2354"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"48934"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"28/04/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/05/2019 - 30/04/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49039&IDKEY=k903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf867624781","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation-Yichang.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-10-22T08:39:36.42Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49821&IDKEY=9iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3k68703159","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS Project Description-draft (005).pdf","uploadDate":"2020-12-04T13:28:07.53Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=52335&IDKEY=ulksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098s72169965","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS Project Description-Yichang Final.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-04-28T18:29:11.233Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=50733&IDKEY=mlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309